{
  "epId": 7083,
  "name": "天使",
  "desc": "<p>它们也被称为天上的使者，主要职责是帮助人类。后来它们被逐出天空岛，最终失去了形体与心智。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/17/326985891/2aa6b47bf4316be4c736d48e07f765e4_7709871144929088989.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1780565817,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名天使"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最初的天使\n最初的天使居于大地至深处的银树之畔。当一位天外旅人向她问及世界最为禁忌的起源，并毫无保留的坦露自身来历后，原初之神为她设下的桎梏顷刻裂散，她也自此寻得了何为自我的御使。这位最初的天使将那原本是高天的主宰拥有的创生之权能交予凡人，而他们借这份权能创造出了",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7626,
        "name": "妖精",
        "desc": "<p>她们是初代冰神，白沙皇的追随者，由巨兽的遗骸与倾落的霜月之光纺所创造。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/8bfe123477466c3c8a09fbff5702b087_5876833777990693498.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。她与那位旅人坠入爱河，决意一同违抗天理定下的法则。\n而这场的背叛，最初的天使被剥夺去名讳与形骸，所有的天使自此亦被烙下诅咒：若是胆敢再凝视他人的眼瞳，将本应属于众生的怜爱献予一人，那得赐于高天的瑰美形体便要溃散成风，心智也要殒落于尘中，直至那堕落者的残躯蜷成仙灵，在永世徘徊中吞咽记忆的残影。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7073,
        "name": "夜神",
        "desc": "<p>一位在纳塔创造了夜神之国的天使。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/26/326985891/6b241f723a377795d5a2ef3c3e97200b_5199845284312467778.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在纳塔创造了",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7425,
        "name": "夜神之国",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/31/521db55cb0ff4168c82d1e1fb4dcd4bb_1469031071010695067.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的夜神，是一位天使。\n西比尔\n一位历经了第一次怒涛中幸存下来的先知，失去了神志与形体，化作金蜂之姿现身。西比尔预言了",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4813,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的兴衰，最终为使",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4779,
        "name": "雷穆斯",
        "desc": "<p>建立雷穆利亚之王。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/20/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_6342016945205081701.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "能创作出伟大乐章「福波斯」，献出了自己的生命。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4912,
        "name": "娜布·玛莉卡塔",
        "desc": "<p>花神，大慈树王与赤王的挚友。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_6115228951106138458.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "娜布•玛莉卡塔是保留了身形与心智的少数天使之一。她与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4911,
        "name": "阿赫玛尔",
        "desc": "<p>须弥三神王之一，曾经统治古代大地四方的君王。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_2833919335886584962.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "和",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4910,
        "name": "大慈树王",
        "desc": "<p>初代草神，也是智慧之神。娜布·玛莉卡塔与赤王的挚友。为了不让世界树继续遭受禁忌知识的污染，大慈树王从世界树中被彻底抹除。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/283cea7d534af180f1561b619e60e0f7_6776115350797876271.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "共同统治须弥。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6369,
        "name": "尼可",
        "desc": "<p>魔女会八位元老之一，喜欢凭空在一个人脑海中说话。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/07/59155606/4caf7dfd1f6b30bbc58610ca6860a918_2312337544050992717.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一位保留了身形与心智、但却失去了声音的天使之一。她曾帮助过",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8939,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的人们。尼可也是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5748,
        "name": "魔女会",
        "desc": "<p>一个在茶会上讨论秘密，并探索世界树的秘密结社。魔女会一共有八位魔女。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/18/326985891/7e361b6e509e4197a2d7ce89f277c472_1815518463202639303.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的成员之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "name": "天理",
        "desc": "<p>第一位降临者，击败了世间的七位龙王，并创造了人类。原初的那一位或许便是法涅斯。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_3593056138001658182.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「天理」以自身光芒创造出天使。它们那苍银羽翼犹如月芒闪烁的光焰，头戴地骨与天星铸就的七重烜赫冠冕，其名为高天的神明许诺众生的爱，亦或是代行统领地上万国之事的威权。天使们曾是诸神庭院中最忠诚的佣仆，亦是在它们庇佑下得以繁衍生息的人类的使者。\n在与天外入侵者的战事结束后，天使们被逐出天空岛，最终失却了形体与心智。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "三月女神",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉亚、桑娜妲与卡侬——是三位姐妹，也是曾经统治苍穹的月神。哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅是在三月女神陨落数千年后诞生的月神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/02/317661877/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_1336603059689273640.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "天使们曾与艾莉亚、卡侬与桑娜妲关系密切。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7082,
        "name": "仙灵",
        "desc": "<p>它们曾经是引导人类的伟大种族。却因遭诅咒，退化成了只剩本能的空壳。它们如今只能引领追随者找到被隐藏的宝物。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/326985891/7f7c0e4acd83db648629de72adbc1b5d_3170300635469190556.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在被逐出之后，天使们退化成仙灵—留下的空壳会本能地为冒险家们引领向宝藏的方向。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4900,
        "name": "安德留斯",
        "desc": "<p>北风的王狼，奔狼领的守护者，四风守护之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/15/157749474/2ac7ad0e18377b4a7b7fc2032f318cc3_8911125565874192452.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在最初的天使失去名讳与记忆后，一只狼闯进了她的宫殿。她将他取名为玻瑞亚斯，教他人类的语言，并赐予他力量。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关书籍与物品"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7785,
        "name": "苍耀",
        "desc": "原本如同拂晓的白星般纯净的无垢之刃，如今已被染上幽蓝的黯色。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/12/0809293ee527b40073c4c9636eff6dd0_2992571952915882222.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2350,
        "name": "醉客轶事",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/book/A Drunkard's Tale_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2338,
        "name": "绝云记闻",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/book/Records of Jueyun_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7572,
        "name": "深廊终曲",
        "desc": "<p>由北国的玉石打造而成的冰之花，花瓣已然在漫长的岁月中湮落成尘。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/bf39402f87db1168263c7c0898c8ab0c_4434336707917443666.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9151,
        "name": "晨星与月的晓歌",
        "desc": "<p>古时为空月女神塑像的工匠，为彰显神明华美的容姿而精心雕琢的花饰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/12/ef58ecfcb8906792c3a9b07c92586934_3343384077195352394.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      }
    ],
